  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia Acute Hunger Crisis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">154.000 people and 12 institutions in Amhara, Somali and Tigray are supported with integrated WASH programming. PGI, CEA and MHPSS are mainstreamed throughout all activities. This bilateral response is an integral part the broader Movement EA and contributes to its objective of reaching 10% (2 million people)of the food insecure population in Ethiopia through a bridged two tier approach of immediate needs assistance and early recovery with integrated multi sector interventions by  June2025.</narrative>
  </description>
